ское учреждение.)","media":[{"asset_id":"img-ddc94d02e126abfb","url":"/media/img-ddc94d02e126abfb.png","content_type":"image/png","association":"source-layout-adjacent-instruction","source_image_shape_id":"7","rights_status":"uncertain","review_required":true}],"next":null,"input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4582","canonical_node_id":"57e9e91f-6b51-519e-9ccf-0db61286ecb2"}},{"id":"c54e7b04-1ed8-5c63-b343-60f99ba78773","role":"instruction","text":"B","media":[],"next":"57e9e91f-6b51-519e-9ccf-0db61286ecb2","input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4583","canonical_node_id":"c54e7b04-1ed8-5c63-b343-60f99ba78773"}},{"id":"25c49aa3-4cdf-5aa6-b231-0aa381e8c7e1","role":"end","text":"Contact pediatrician\nСвяжитесь с педиатром","media":[{"asset_id":"img-86669fb9620744a6","url":"/media/img-86669fb9620744a6.png","content_type":"image/png","association":"source-layout-adjacent-instruction","source_image_shape_id":"9","rights_status":"uncertain","review_required":true}],"next":null,"input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4585","canonical_node_id":"25c49aa3-4cdf-5aa6-b231-0aa381e8c7e1"}},{"id":"af3dd232-5b73-5395-be6c-649b2baf28a3","role":"instruction","text":"C","media":[],"next":"25c49aa3-4cdf-5aa6-b231-0aa381e8c7e1","input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4586","canonical_node_id":"af3dd232-5b73-5395-be6c-649b2baf28a3"}},{"id":"1dad8f2a-1ec8-5f43-a3f4-c3e9966916dd","role":"instruction","text":"0","media":[],"next":"25c49aa3-4cdf-5aa6-b231-0aa381e8c7e1","input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4587","canonical_node_id":"1dad8f2a-1ec8-5f43-a3f4-c3e9966916dd"}},{"id":"c191ce40-1fab-545c-b74e-1e9fce869193","role":"end","text":"1. На изображении бедро должно быть оголённым.\n2. Вместо взрослого пострадавшего 7 летний ребёнок","media":[],"next":null,"input":null,"source":{"original_shape_id":"4591","canonical_node_id":"c191ce40-1fab-545c-b74e-1e9fce869193"}},{"id":"85f21d63-9462-5854-827c-9af24073ff78","role":"end","text":"Вместо взрослого пострадавшего 7 летн